  "id": "stenosis",
  "term": "stenosis",
  "definition": "Stenosis is a narrowing of a blood vessel; in this packet, it refers to narrowing in an intracranial artery such as the middle cerebral artery. The packet indicates that greater narrowing can alter blood flow, pressure, and shear forces, but that its effects depend on both the vessel’s geometry and the blood’s viscosity.",
